      "id": "Reactive.Boolean",
      "range": "[1.2.0, )"
    },
    "message": "The scheduling operators (TrueForAtLeast, PersistTrueFor, WhenTrueFor, LimitTrueDuration and their False variants) in this version can produce incorrect output: cold or burst sources (SelectMany, Concat, ToObservable) may emit wrong values, a pending timer value can leak when the source completes, LimitTrueDuration stops limiting after a repeated true, and TrueForAtLeast silently restarts its timer on a repeated true. All of these are fixed in 1.2.0. Logical operators (And/Or/Xor/Not) and Subscribe helpers are unaffected. Please upgrade to 1.2.0 or later.",
    "reasons": [
      "CriticalBugs"
    ]
  },
  "description": "Reactive Extensions meant specifically for implementations of IObservable<bool>",
